<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR ACCOUNT / YOUR WORKSPACE</view><view class="title">我的工作账户</view><view class="hero"><view class="hero-title">{{username}}</view><text class="badge">{{role}}</text><view class="muted gap">账户权限由管理员分配，与管理网页共用。</view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="strong">当前业务口径</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row small"><text>币种</text><text>CNY · 人民币（历史单按原币种）</text></view><view class="row small gap"><text>业务时区</text><text>Asia/Shanghai · 北京时间</text></view><view class="hint">资金通过线下现金或独立终端处理，系统登记收款、退款及结算事实。</view></view>
  <block wx:if="{{pending.length}}"><view class="section-title">待核对操作 · {{pending.length}}</view><view class="notice">上次连接中断的操作保存在本机。先核对原操作结果，避免重复开单或重复收付款。</view><view wx:for="{{pending}}" wx:key="storageKey" class="card"><view class="row"><text class="strong">{{item.title}}</text><button class="ghost compact" bindtap="retry" data-index="{{index}}" disabled="{{busy}}">继续核对</button></view></view></block>
  <view class="section-title">修改密码</view><view class="card"><label class="label">当前密码</label><input password value="{{currentPassword}}" data-field="currentPassword" bindinput="input" maxlength="200" disabled="{{busy}}"/><label class="label">新密码</label><input password value="{{newPassword}}" data-field="newPassword" bindinput="input" placeholder="至少 16 个字符" maxlength="200" disabled="{{busy}}"/><label class="label">再次输入新密码</label><input password value="{{confirmPassword}}" data-field="confirmPassword" bindinput="input" maxlength="200" disabled="{{busy}}"/><button class="ghost gap" bindtap="password" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">修改并重新登录</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="danger gap" bindtap="logout" disabled="{{busy}}">退出登录</button><view class="footer">FOXCORE RETAIL · STAFF EDITION</view>
</view>
